<title>POLAND: Rolimpex plans floating subsidiaries.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex plans floating subsidiaries.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish food trader Rolimpex SA plans to place some of its subsidiaries on the Warsaw Stock Exchange, but no sooner than in 1998, the president of the company said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't plan any placings on the bourse next year, but we think about it and I would like to prepare some of our companies for floating,&quot; Roman Mlyniec told a news conference.</p>
<p>He did not give any further details.</p>
<p>Rolimpex currently has 46 subsidiaries and seven affiliates.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
